dvaJAo6Z99x3lUQlS4etgEb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1: </strong>M&ocirc; tả tỉ lệ của c&aacute;c loại <strong>nhi&ecirc;n liệu sạch</strong> <strong>(Nuclear v&agrave; Hydro and Wind) </strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WrlIdcrThoLWcIxeiIUlPTLsg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2: </strong>M&ocirc; tả tỉ lệ của c&aacute;c loại nhi&ecirc;n liệu c&ograve;n lại <strong>(Coal and lignite, Petroleum Products, v&agrave; Other)</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> C&aacute;ch viết từng c&acirc;u:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WmZmdTBuno2TMIx2y6zl9EQGgRd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcOkdRMB3oglFQx3YSslSvXpgbe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VzPUdBpFmosYQyx4NFOl79YRgKh\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLrHdc701owzfzxHR4Al2Nq3ggc\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"10\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"11\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"12\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng như sau:</span></div>\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PaNsdg4aJoiIzmxn90MlYcMmgph\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AGDydth80oebYexEfxplMtTNgZe\">\n<div>\n<h4><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: Nuclear v&agrave; Hydro &amp; Wind</strong></span></h4>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CWmZdrWWyoHpfbxU5fllfJMuged\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> <strong>Nuclear </strong>cao nhất ở Japan (49%) v&agrave; South Korea (33%).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-InNfdnq7eoLCa5xUGF5ll4Szgcg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> <strong>Nuclear</strong> được sử dụng vừa phải ở Malaysia (19%) v&agrave; Singapore (13%), kh&ocirc;ng được sử dụng ở Thailand.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CwwUdSrl3o6ExixTGOtlKEzBgHe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 3:</strong> <strong>Hydro and wind</strong> cao nhất ở South Korea (48%), theo sau l&agrave; Thailand (19%), v&agrave; được sử dụng rất &iacute;t ở 3 nước c&ograve;n lại (kh&ocirc;ng qu&aacute; 5%).</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-POmCdOZqcoz7kZxdgs6lLaKggkg\">\n<div>\n<h4><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong> <strong>Coal and Lignite, Petroleum Products, v&agrave; Other</strong></span></h4>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HTs7d6fpOo4ia1xHvV6l3aA4gEc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> <strong>Coal and lignite</strong> được sử dụng nhiều nhất ở Malaysia (61%) v&agrave; Singapore (42%), trong khi 3 nước c&ograve;n lại d&ugrave;ng kh&ocirc;ng qu&aacute; 6%.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4Ikdv6ieoDFOKxPYcOlbGaig1b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> <strong>Petroleum products</strong> chỉ được d&ugrave;ng nhiều ở Thailand (36%), v&agrave; chỉ chiếm khoảng 2-3% ở c&aacute;c nước c&ograve;n lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H4rEdJyFuo40pixIDSyl4TIrgxe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 3:</strong> C&aacute;c loại nhi&ecirc;n liệu thuộc nh&oacute;m <strong>Other</strong> được d&ugrave;ng nhiều nhất ở Thailand (42%), cao hơn Singapore v&agrave; Japan (c&ugrave;ng bằng 39%), v&agrave; chỉ chiếm hơn một phần mười tổng sản lượng điện ở Malaysia v&agrave; South Korea.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FzcsdRMXSoU9ngxhPmbljcEIgZf\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Paraphrasing &amp; Vocabulary:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GLbhdbCKwovei2xJSsEld7p6gXg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPvMdqRXDoplk8xtrh1lYqWGgrg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F2Vtd4Bh5o78qrxglSlljNPXgRh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EPpsdqC9toqdYixpO5Hlu4sDgtc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div>Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y phải n&oacute;i về <strong>tổng sản lượng điện</strong> nhiều, bạn c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng những c&aacute;ch nhau để đa dạng từ ngữ nh&eacute;. Ngo&agrave;i ra, để gọi chung c&aacute;c loại <strong>năng lượng sạch </strong>th&igrave; cũng c&oacute; một v&agrave;i c&aacute;ch d&ugrave;ng từ kh&aacute;c nhau để tr&aacute;nh lặp nha.</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S6mWdBIfhoOAw7xw8YclTu8UgIc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Electricity generation:</strong> electricity production, electricity, total electrical power</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XNkRdOwVao4BZsx5gdxlX5whg1c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Cleaner options:</strong> eco-friendly sources, renewable sources</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D8RcdpL1zoUROSx7dhCl7NUhgmO\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Một số từ vựng nổi bật:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UC44dRwszoNaiExL6KxlOrxWgWd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>fossil fuels: </strong>nhi&ecirc;n liệu h&oacute;a thạch || d&ugrave;ng để gọi chung c&aacute;c loại than v&agrave; sản phẩm từ xăng dầu</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZJLldGFqro69Vox3deKlnzecggg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>marked differences in [sth]:</strong> sự kh&aacute;c biệt r&otilde; rệt</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LN7gdkfruoKldMxNS5ClcX2SgCc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>unavailable</strong><strong> (adj)</strong><strong>:</strong> kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; / kh&ocirc;ng được sử dụng</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C6DZdUnmnoFRILxHkqdlpciVgPc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>remain minimal:</strong> ở mức rất thấp</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DZted3QgTo6884xP4aLlQfqJgEc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>negligible</strong><strong> (adj)</strong><strong>:</strong> kh&ocirc;ng đ&aacute;ng kể</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
